@startuml
title find_me_in_wood — CODE policy: out-of-band (OOB) join processing
autonumber
participant "A\ncreator" as A
participant "OOB channel\nQR / NFC / voice" as OOB
participant "B\njoiner" as B
participant "Transport\nBLE / WiFiDirect / LoRa" as T
participant "C\nmembers" as C

== Creation (creator side) ==
A -> A : create "hunt-2026", gen secret (>=128 bit)\nnetworkId = HKDF(secret,"net-id")[0..8]\ntrafficKey = HKDF(secret,"aead")\nvtag = HKDF(secret,"verify")[0..4]
A -> A : join code = "hunt-2026#<secret>#<vtag>"
A -> OOB : show QR / read out code

== OOB transfer (the only trusted channel) ==
OOB -> B : QR scan | NFC tap | manual typing
B -> B : parse name#secret#vtag
B -> B : vtag == HKDF(secret,"verify")[0..4] ?\nno -> FAIL fast (typo), radio stays silent\nyes -> store profile {name=label,\nnetId, trafficKey}
B -> B : generate memberId_B (Ed25519)
note over B : name is a local label only — never transmitted

== Transport association (transport-specific, carries no trust) ==
alt BLE
  B -> T : BLE scan -> peers advertising app UUID\nGATT connect
else WiFi Direct
  B -> T : WFD discover -> group negotiate\n(owner/client)
else LoRa
  B -> T : open node link (BLE serial to node)\nnode owns the air interface
end

== Radio join (first contact = key confirmation) ==
B -> B : listen: collect frames,\nfilter netId == local netId
C ->> T : beacon {netId, senderId=IdC,\nseq, AEAD(payload, trafficKey)}
T ->> B : deliver frame
B -> B : AEAD open with trafficKey\nok -> member IdC visible (TOFU)\nfail -> drop (wrong net / noise),\nauth-fail counter++
B ->> T : first beacon {netId, senderId=IdB,\nseq=0, AEAD}
T ->> C : deliver
C -> C : AEAD ok -> PeerState(B) created\n(membership proven, FR-2.3)
note over B, C : no handshake messages at all —\nOOB secret + AEAD success replace the handshake
@enduml
